@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title Operator property event (approved design, not implemented)

start
:Operator submits one action\n(one or more property values);
:Validate the whole event:
identity join (stale program identity?)
and every value (type, finite, min/max/step);
if (Stale or any value invalid?) then (yes)
  :Reject the whole event;\nno mutation; prior values kept;
  stop
else (all valid)
  :Apply at its effective\nevent position;
  :New settings revision /\neffective position;
endif
note right
Unchanged: program/source/bytecode,
run identity, deployment package.
No recompile, repackage, or
controller-wide maintenance stop.
Open: durability and failure ordering.
end note
:Active logic responds\nunder existing rules;
stop
@enduml
